  "sundayFull": "Jumapili",
  "hadith0": "\"Amali zinazopendwa zaidi na Mwenyezi Mungu ni zile zinazodumishwa, hata zikiwa ndogo.\"\n— Bukhari na Muslim",
  "hadith2": "\"Mwanaadamu anapokufa, amali zake zinakoma isipokuwa tatu: sadaka jariya, elimu yenye manufaa, au mtoto mwema anayemuombea dua.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith3": "\"Anayeswali swala mbili za baridi (Alfajiri na Alasiri) ataingia Peponi.\"\n— Bukhari",
  "hadith4": "\"Mwenyezi Mungu haangalii sura zenu wala mali zenu, bali anaangalia nyoyo zenu na amali zenu.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith6": "\"Rahisisheni mambo wala msiyafanye magumu; toeni bishara njema wala msiwakimbize watu.\"\n— Bukhari",
  "hadith7": "\"Anayeshika njia ya kutafuta elimu, Mwenyezi Mungu atamrahisishia njia ya kwenda Peponi.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith8": "\"Sadaka haipunguzi mali.\"\n— Muslim",
  "hadith9": "\"Muumini mwenye nguvu ni bora na mpendwa zaidi kwa Mwenyezi Mungu kuliko muumini dhaifu, ingawa wote wana kheri.\"\n— Muslim",
  "historyDayCompleted": "{completed} kati ya {total} yamekamilika",
  "settingsSchedule": "Ratiba",
  "settingsAppearance": "Mwonekano",
  "settingsAboutTagline": "Msaidizi wako wa kila siku katika dini",
  "settingsRolloverSub": "Siku mpya inapoanza",
  "hadith10": "\"Mtu anayesema 'SubhanAllah wa bihamdihi' mara mia kwa siku, dhambi zake zitasamehewa hata kama zingekuwa kama povu la bahari.\"\n— Bukhari na Muslim",
  "hadith12": "\"Mtu anayesoma Ayatul Kursi baada ya kila swala ya faradhi, hakuna kinachomzuia kuingia Peponi isipokuwa kifo.\"\n— Nasa'i",
  "hadith13": "\"Neno jema ni sadaka.\"\n— Bukhari na Muslim",
  "hadith14": "\"Mwenye kuamini Mwenyezi Mungu na Siku ya Mwisho, na aseme jema au anyamaze.\"\n— Bukhari na Muslim",
  "hadith15": "\"Anayemtunza mjane au maskini ni kama mpiganaji katika njia ya Mwenyezi Mungu.\"\n— Bukhari na Muslim",
  "hadith16": "\"Tabasamu lako mbele ya ndugu yako ni sadaka.\"\n— Tirmidhi",
  "hadith17": "\"Bora kati yenu ni yule anayejifunza Qurani na kuifundisha.\"\n— Bukhari",
  "hadith18": "\"Hakuna mtu aliyekula chakula bora kuliko kile alichokipata kwa kazi ya mikono yake.\"\n— Bukhari",
  "hadith19": "\"Mwenyezi Mungu ni mpole na anapenda upole katika kila jambo.\"\n— Bukhari na Muslim",
  "settingsAbout": "Kuhusu",
  "settingsVersion": "Toleo",
  "settingsDeveloper": "Msanidi",
  "settingsSupport": "Usaidizi",
  "settingsRate": "Kadiria programu",
  "settingsContact": "Wasiliana nasi",
  "settingsReportBug": "Ripoti hitilafu",
